      "problem": "Calculate ${\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{5\\pi /6}{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$",
      "worked_solution": "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{5\\pi /6}{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x{|}_{\\pi /2}^{5\\pi /6} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{6})-(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})) \\\\  & =-(-\\sqrt{3})-0 \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
